{"id":"f1d156eef84de1db","group":"89","path":"89/89-lem-modalized-replacement.md","title":"Boxed Replacement in Modalized Contexts","display":"lem-modalized-replacement — Boxed Replacement in Modalized Contexts","type":"lemma","metadata":{"type":"lemma","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-lem-modalized-replacement","aliases":["89-lem-modalized-replacement"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"lem-modalized-replacement — Boxed Replacement in Modalized Contexts","depends_on":["[[89-df-modalized]]","[[89-lem-k4-internal-replacement]]"],"revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"lemma"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-lem-modalized-replacement"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-lem-modalized-replacement</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"lem-modalized-replacement — Boxed Replacement in Modalized Contexts"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"138d8c34e0370a6b\" href=\"?note=138d8c34e0370a6b\" title=\"89-df-modalized\">89-df-modalized</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"bb03b454c0564b96\" href=\"?note=bb03b454c0564b96\" title=\"89-lem-k4-internal-replacement\">89-lem-k4-internal-replacement</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Modalized}(F,p)\">\\(\\mathrm{Modalized}(F,p)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{K4}\">\\(\\mathrm{K4}\\)</span> 为定理集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box^+\">\\(\\Box^+\\)</span> 为 dotted box，结构代入写 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[p:=B]\">\\([p:=B]\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modalized\\text{-}replacement}\\vdash\n(\\Box(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to\\Box^+(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modalized\\text{-}replacement}\\vdash\n(\\Box(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to\\Box^+(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 8、104、112；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p>模态化公式由不含当前 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 的字母、底和盒公式作布尔组合。盒公式 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box D\">\\(\\Box D\\)</span> 的未加盒等价由加强替换的第三式得到；布尔组合保持这一结果。所以带盒前件足以推出当前世界的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 等价。加强替换第三式还对任意 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F\">\\(F\\)</span> 给盒化后的等价，二者合取就是所示 dotted box。该推论说明模态化条件在哪里使当前世界的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\">\\(p\\)</span> 值可以被忽略。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modalized","status":"resolved","id":"138d8c34e0370a6b","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modalized]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-lem-k4-internal-replacement","status":"resolved","id":"bb03b454c0564b96","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-lem-k4-internal-replacement]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Modalized}(F,p)","display":false},{"tex":"B,C\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{K4}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box^+","display":false},{"tex":"[p:=B]","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{lem\\text{-}modalized\\text{-}replacement}\\vdash\n(\\Box(B\\leftrightarrow C)\\to\\Box^+(F[p:=B]\\leftrightarrow F[p:=C]))\\in\\mathrm{K4}.","display":true},{"tex":"p","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box D","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"F","display":false},{"tex":"p","display":false}],"bytes":1314,"backlinks":[{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-25","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般替换：[[89-lem-normal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-k4-internal-replacement]] → [[89-lem-modalized-replacement]]。普通 DNF：[[89-df-gl-normal-form]] → [[89-lem-gl-decomposition]] → [[89-lem-gl-normal-form]]。"}],"outgoing":["138d8c34e0370a6b","bb03b454c0564b96"]}